sweep of a dependent subckt parameter
ground 0
load "resistor.osdi"
model vs vsource
model r resistor
v1 (in 0) vs dc=1
x1 (in out) sec
subckt sec (a b)
  parameters w=1000
  parameters l=2*w
  parameters $mfactor=1.0
  r1 (a b) r r=l
  r2 (b 0) r r=1k
ends
control
  options rawfile="ascii"
  analysis op1 op
  sweep s1 instance="x1" parameter="w" values=[1000, 2000]
    analysis dc1 op
  sweep s2 instance="x1" parameter="l" values=[1000, 3000]
    analysis dc2 op
  alter instance("x1") l=5000
  analysis op3 op
endc
